    "description": "You will be able to get to know more friends in an Arabic chat that includes thousands of Arab users from different countries and enjoys the best continuous updates.\r\n\r\nThere are many people who aspire to get to know you, just take the initiative to register in the original to be able to reach them.\r\n\r\nYou will be able to get to know friends in the public chat. You will also find that there are many different rooms waiting for you so that you can conduct conversations and move between them, the most important of which is the Yemen chat, as well as the Morocco chat, the Egypt chat, and many other rooms waiting for you.\r\n\r\nYou can have a wonderful correspondence in an Arabic chat with any person in private. Just send him a friend request so that you can engage in a private conversation with him, but you must adhere to the rules presented in the chat.",
